        <div class="demo-frame d-flex align-items-stretch gap-2 mt-2"><div class="demo-box p-6">haut</div><div class="demo-box p-2">stretch</div></div>
        <p class="mt-4">align-self : un enfant s'aligne autrement que les autres (parent en align-items-start)</p>
        <div class="demo-frame d-flex align-items-start gap-2 mt-2">
            <div class="demo-box p-6">haut</div>
            <div class="demo-box p-2">start</div>
            <div class="demo-box p-2 align-self-center">align-self-center</div>
